; Engine configuration file.
; It's best edited using the editor UI and not directly,
; since the parameters that go here are not all obvious.
;
; Format:
;   [section]
;
; section may be for a given mode, e.g. [3D], and the editor
; will only show options that are relevant to those sections.
; If the section is empty, the section only appears as a comment,
; and the editor will ignore it, only yielding the content after
; the section header to the "external" reources type.


